"cbr-p003701","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0101","start":101,"end":104,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003703","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代；不補姓名、成員與特定齊君。"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003701","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan","book_id":"b-shiji-062","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-062-guanyan"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:p002","text":"管仲曰：「吾始困時，嘗與鮑叔賈，分財利多自與，鮑叔不以我為貪，知我貧也。吾嘗為鮑叔謀事而更窮困，鮑叔不以我為愚，知時有利不利也。吾嘗三仕三見逐於君，鮑叔不以我為不肖，知我不遭時也。吾嘗三戰三走，鮑叔不以我怯，知我有老母也。公子糾敗，召忽死之，吾幽囚受辱，鮑叔不以我為無恥，知我不羞小節而恥功名不顯于天下也。生我者父母，知我者鮑子也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003701","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m002-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m002-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m002-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m002-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m002-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代；不補姓名、成員與特定齊君。"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m002-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisiona